        "original_id": "49799f0a-e775-5c1c-a09c-e81f385b11c2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Nicholls, Norman Blake, Lachlan West, Tim John\n- Bands: The Vines, Teenage Fanclub\n- Works: Wicked Nature, \"He's a Rocker\", Melodia\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, guitarist, producer, drummer, bassist\n- Places: Australia, Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland, Glasgow\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Blake was born on 20 October 1965 in Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland.\n- Craig Robert Nicholls was born on 31 August 1977 and is an Australian musician.\n- Norman Blake is a singer, instrumentalist, and songwriter in the Glasgow-based band Teenage Fanclub.\n- Craig Nicholls is the lead singer, songwriter, and guitarist of the Australian alternative rock band The Vines, and he is the band's only mainstay member.\n- \"He's a Rocker\" is a song by the Australian rock band The Vines and was the first single from their 2008 album Melodia.\n- Wicked Nature marked Craig Nicholls's first time serving as producer for The Vines.\n- Wicked Nature also introduced a new rhythm section for The Vines with drummer Lachlan West and bassist Tim John.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
